[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the bracket to the chassis.</p><p>2. Remove the mounting bracket from the engine bay.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033949.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the air cleaner bracket.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Unscrew the bolts securing the bracket to the body.</p><p>2. Unscrew the nuts securing the dehydrating filter to the bracket.</p><p>3. Remove the bracket from the engine bay.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034138.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the bracket.</p><p>Tighten the bolt and nuts securing the\ndehydrating filter to the bracket.</p><p>Tighten the bolts retaining the brackets\nto the body.</p>"]]